<%# Org-wide meetings index ("Alle Meetings", Gespräche Slice 1c): "all
    conversations with person X" across project boundaries. Since 17.10.2026 the
    same list as the project meetings page: the shared filter bar above a list
    frame that the bar, the column heads and the pages reload. A row opens the
    meeting in its own project's master-detail (the lane here comes with PR 3 of
    doc/meetings_uebersicht_vereinheitlichen_plan.md).

    index-page restores the list on Back and Forward: the bar pushes history
    entries of its own ({ lane: true }), which Turbo leaves alone. viewport
    reloads the page below the breakpoint with ?viewport=mobile, as on the
    project page. %>
<% content_for :head do %>
  <meta name="turbo-cache-control" content="no-cache">
<% end %>

<%# The expert filter of the bar's view menu opens into this frame. %>
<turbo-frame id="modal"></turbo-frame>

<div class="w-full"
     data-controller="index-page viewport"
     data-index-page-param-name-value="meeting_id"
     data-index-page-frame-id-value="meeting_display_frame"
     data-lane-params="<%= lane_params_json(selection: %w[meeting_id]) %>"
     data-viewport-current-mode-value="<%= @viewport_mode %>">
  <%= render 'organisations/meetings_overview/list_head' %>
  <%= render 'organisations/meetings_overview/results', meetings: @meetings, first_use: meetings_overview_first_use? %>
</div>
